8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":4.18,"default_fair_val":4.18,"premium_pct":544.7,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":2.6,"pb_forward":2.3,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":12.02,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":73.5,"cash_to_assets":38.5,"current_ratio":3.55,"roe":18,"roa":8,"moat":{"ticker":"IREN","period":"2026Q4","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 在其軟體服務領域展現了不錯的定價權。雖然沒有像可口可樂那樣的全球性品牌忠誠度，但其專業軟體解決方案在特定行業內建立了相當的聲譽。客戶依賴其軟體來進行關鍵業務運營，這使得 IREN 能夠在一定程度上轉嫁成本並維持利潤率。然而，與其他高度依賴品牌價值的消費品公司相比，其品牌壁壘相對較弱，面臨來自其他技術供應商的競爭壓力，這限制了其極高的定價能力。其品牌價值主要體現在解決方案的有效性和可靠性上，而非情感連結。","comment_en":"IREN Limited demonstrates decent pricing power within its software services domain. While it doesn't possess the global brand loyalty of a Coca-Cola, its specialized software solutions have established a considerable reputation within specific industries. Customers rely on its software for critical business operations, enabling IREN to pass on costs to some extent and maintain profit margins. However, compared to other companies heavily reliant on brand value in consumer goods, its brand barrier is relatively weaker, facing competitive pressure from other technology providers, which limits its exceptionally high pricing power. Its brand value is primarily reflected in the effectiveness and reliability of its solutions, rather than emotional connection."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 在軟體服務領域的專利和監管壁壘是其重要的護城河。軟體開發涉及大量的知識產權，公司的專利組合能夠阻止競爭對手輕易複製其核心技術。此外，某些行業的軟體解決方案可能需要符合嚴格的監管標準，這增加了新進入者的門檻。IREN 在這些領域的持續投入和合規性，為其建立了一個相對穩固的技術和市場壁壘。雖然專利有時效性，但其在特定市場的先發優勢和持續的研發投入，使其能夠維持領先地位。","comment_en":"IREN Limited's patents and regulatory barriers in the software services sector form a significant moat. Software development involves substantial intellectual property, and the company's patent portfolio can prevent competitors from easily replicating its core technologies. Furthermore, software solutions in certain industries may need to comply with strict regulatory standards, increasing the barrier to entry for new players. IREN's continuous investment and compliance in these areas establish a relatively stable technological and market barrier. Although patents have expiration dates, its first-mover advantage in specific markets and ongoing R&D investments allow it to maintain a leading position."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 的軟體解決方案具有極高的客戶轉換成本，這是其最顯著的護城河之一。一旦客戶將 IREN 的軟體整合到其核心業務流程中，遷移到另一家供應商將涉及巨大的時間、金錢和潛在的業務中斷成本。這種深度整合和對 IREN 系統的依賴，使得客戶極難更換供應商。這種黏性極大地增強了客戶的留存率，並為公司提供了穩定的經常性收入，是典型的「收費橋」模式體現。","comment_en":"IREN Limited's software solutions possess extremely high customer switching costs, which is one of its most significant moats. Once customers integrate IREN's software into their core business processes, migrating to another vendor would involve substantial costs in time, money, and potential business disruption. This deep integration and reliance on IREN's systems make it exceedingly difficult for customers to switch vendors. This stickiness greatly enhances customer retention and provides the company with stable recurring revenue, embodying a typical 'toll bridge' model."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 的網絡效應相對有限。雖然其軟體可能在某些協作平台或生態系統中有一定的用戶基礎，但其核心價值並非直接來自於用戶數量的增加而產生的網絡效應。與社交媒體或市場平台不同，IREN 的軟體更多是為了解決單一客戶的特定業務需求。雖然用戶增長可能帶來一些間接的數據優勢或服務改進，但這種效應的強度和範圍不如那些以網絡效應為核心商業模式的公司，因此在此維度上得分中等。","comment_en":"IREN Limited's network effects are relatively limited. While its software might have a certain user base within some collaborative platforms or ecosystems, its core value does not directly stem from network effects generated by an increase in user numbers. Unlike social media or marketplace platforms, IREN's software is primarily designed to address the specific business needs of individual clients. Although user growth might bring some indirect data advantages or service improvements, the strength and scope of this effect are not as pronounced as in companies whose core business model relies on network effects, hence the moderate score in this dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 在規模經濟方面具有一定的成本優勢。隨著公司營收的增長，其軟體開發和維護的固定成本可以被攤銷到更多的用戶和項目上，從而降低單位成本。此外，龐大的客戶基礎也可能使其在採購相關技術或服務時獲得更優惠的價格。然而，軟體行業的研發投入仍然巨大，規模優勢的邊際效益可能不如傳統製造業那樣顯著，但仍足以構成一個堅實的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"IREN Limited possesses certain cost advantages related to economies of scale. As the company's revenue grows, its fixed costs for software development and maintenance can be amortized over more users and projects, thereby reducing unit costs. Additionally, a large customer base may allow it to secure more favorable pricing when procuring related technologies or services. However, R&D investments in the software industry remain substantial, and the marginal benefits of scale may not be as significant as in traditional manufacturing industries, yet it is sufficient to form a solid competitive barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 的業務模式並非高度依賴特定的地理位置或獨特的實體資產。其軟體服務可以全球化部署，不受地理限制。雖然公司可能在某些地區擁有較強的市場滲透率或客戶群，但這更多是市場策略和客戶關係的結果，而非基於稀缺的地理資源或資產。因此，在這一維度上，其壁壘相對較弱，不構成核心競爭優勢。","comment_en":"IREN Limited's business model does not heavily rely on specific geographic locations or unique physical assets. Its software services can be deployed globally, free from geographical constraints. While the company might have strong market penetration or customer bases in certain regions, this is more a result of market strategy and customer relationships rather than being based on scarce geographical resources or assets. Therefore, the barrier in this dimension is relatively weak and does not constitute a core competitive advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 在營運效率方面表現出色，這體現在其穩健的財務指標上，如較高的 ROE 和 ROA，以及強勁的自由現金流 (FCF)。這表明公司能夠有效地利用其資產和資本來產生利潤。高效的營運意味著其能夠以較低的成本提供高價值的服務，並在市場競爭中保持優勢。這種效率是持續研發、優化流程和精準管理能力的體現，是其堅實護城河的一部分。","comment_en":"IREN Limited demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, reflected in its solid financial metrics such as high ROE and ROA, and strong Free Cash Flow (FCF). This indicates the company's ability to effectively utilize its assets and capital to generate profits. Efficient operations mean it can provide high-value services at a lower cost and maintain an advantage in market competition. This efficiency is a manifestation of continuous R&D, optimized processes, and precise management capabilities, forming part of its solid moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 的資本配置能力值得肯定。公司擁有健康的現金儲備，並能產生穩定的自由現金流，這為其提供了進行戰略投資、研發、潛在收購或回購股票的靈活性。從其財務數據來看，公司似乎能夠明智地分配資本以追求長期增長和股東回報。雖然沒有像巴菲特本人那樣的傳奇資本配置記錄，但其穩健的財務狀況和持續的盈利能力表明其資本配置策略是有效的，構成了堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"IREN Limited's capital allocation capabilities are commendable. The company possesses healthy cash reserves and generates stable free cash flow, providing it with the flexibility for strategic investments, R&D, potential acquisitions, or share buybacks. Judging by its financial data, the company appears to allocate capital wisely to pursue long-term growth and shareholder returns. While it may not have a legendary capital allocation track record like Buffett himself, its sound financial position and consistent profitability indicate an effective capital allocation strategy, forming a solid moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 在客戶保留方面表現極為出色，這主要歸功於其軟體解決方案的高轉換成本（M3）。一旦客戶深度採用其系統，並將其整合到關鍵業務流程中，他們將面臨巨大的阻力來尋求替代方案。這種黏性確保了高度穩定的客戶基礎和可預測的經常性收入流。這種強大的客戶忠誠度和留存率，是其作為一家優秀軟體服務公司的核心競爭力，堪比「收費橋」的穩定性。","comment_en":"IREN Limited excels in customer retention, primarily due to the high switching costs (M3) associated with its software solutions. Once customers deeply adopt its systems and integrate them into critical business processes, they face significant hurdles in seeking alternatives. This stickiness ensures a highly stable customer base and predictable recurring revenue streams. This strong customer loyalty and retention rate are core competitive strengths of an excellent software services company, comparable to the stability of a 'toll bridge'."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"IREN Limited 的業務模式具有相當的持久性。軟體服務，特別是那些深度整合到客戶業務中的解決方案，往往具有較長的生命週期。只要 IREN 能持續創新並適應市場變化，其核心產品就能保持相關性和競爭力。雖然技術變革是軟體行業的常態，但其建立的客戶依賴性和轉換成本（M3）為其提供了抵抗顛覆的堅實基礎。其專利和持續的研發投入也進一步增強了其業務的持久性。","comment_en":"IREN Limited's business model possesses considerable durability. Software services, especially those deeply integrated into customer operations, tend to have long lifecycles. As long as IREN can continuously innovate and adapt to market changes, its core products can remain relevant and competitive. Although technological disruption is a norm in the software industry, the customer dependency and switching costs (M3) it has established provide a solid foundation against disruption. Its patents and ongoing R&D investments further enhance the durability of its business."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"IREN Limited 的護城河主要建立在其軟體解決方案極高的客戶轉換成本（M3）和由此產生的客戶黏性（M9）之上，這構成了類似「收費橋」的穩定收入來源。此外，其專利和技術壁壘（M2）、營運效率（M7）以及一定的規模經濟（M5）和資本配置能力（M8）也提供了堅實的支持。雖然品牌定價權（M1）和網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，但整體而言，IREN 展現了一個具有持久性（M10）和強大客戶保留能力的優秀軟體服務企業的特徵，其經濟護城河相當穩固。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"IREN Limited's moat is primarily built upon the extremely high customer switching costs (M3) of its software solutions and the resulting customer stickiness (M9), forming a stable revenue stream akin to a 'toll bridge'. Additionally, its patents and technological barriers (M2), operational efficiency (M7), along with certain economies of scale (M5) and capital allocation capabilities (M8), provide solid support. While brand pricing power (M1) and network effects (M4) are relatively weaker, overall, IREN exhibits the characteristics of an excellent software services company with durability (M10) and strong customer retention, possessing a quite robust economic moat.","evidenceHash":"36358de25279e62377f1235be43bd1aa985aa1e777391c227507180db60722dc","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T15:49:45.330Z","evidenceHash":"7d123ba45061e584c3e5094407cd4a0fc78840f8bc686ec081c40c1f6403dde0"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T15:49:45.330Z","evidenceHash":"7d123ba45061e584c3e5094407cd4a0fc78840f8bc686ec081c40c1f6403dde0"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/IREN.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/IREN.png","website":"https://iren.com","ceo":"William Roberts","full_time_employees":"685","description":"IREN Limited, established in 2018 and based in Sydney, Australia, operates a comprehensive, vertically integrated data center business spanning Australia and Canada. The company possesses and manages all essential infrastructure, including its computing hardware, electrical systems, and the data center facilities themselves. A primary undertaking for IREN Limited is the mining of Bitcoin, a scarce digital asset created and exchanged via a decentralized, peer-to-peer computer network utilizing specialized Bitcoin software. The company was previously named Iris Energy Limited, officially adopting IREN Limited in November 2024.","description_en":"IREN Limited, established in 2018 and based in Sydney, Australia, operates a comprehensive, vertically integrated data center business spanning Australia and Canada. The company possesse